# Protected Core Files

## Context
Core infrastructure and engine code of the app.

## Rules
- `app/src/store.ts` (the dispatch/notify engine) and `app/src/types.ts` (core types and Action discriminated union) are **protected core files**.
- Treat them as "do-not-touch without approval".
- Normal feature work or task implementation must only extend `reducer.ts`, `actions.ts`, or `selectors.ts`. Do NOT alter the core engine files unless explicitly requested.

## How to verify
- Run `git diff app/src/store.ts app/src/types.ts` before staging or committing changes to verify no unauthorized modifications were made to the core engine.
